# Adapted from Aurum's chapter aurum-druid/hall-of-thanes (Aurums Night Elf Druid Guide 0.4.37,
# GPL-3.0, github.com/AurumTitanos/Aurums-Night-Elf-Druid-Guide), itself built on Polestar's guides.
# Changes: for every class and race, druid-only and profession steps removed, shorter tips,
# group notes added. Quest ids, givers and levels cross-checked against Polestar 0.3.2's
# reference data, Polestar's Dungeons codex and RestedXP's free Forever dungeon guide (11-20).
guide groupe-alliance/04-salle-des-thanes
title Group 3 · The Hall of Thanes (dungeon 13-17)
folder Group Alliance
category Dungeons
faction Alliance
levels 13-17
zone Ironforge
next groupe-alliance/05-sombrivage

step Deeprun Tram to Ironforge
  zone Ironforge
  tip Every player takes these quests before the run. Keep 6 free quest log slots.
  getfp "Ironforge"

step Steelgrill's Depot
  zone Dun Morogh
  accept 96408

step Earthseer Farsen
  tip His camp overlooks Gol'Bolar Quarry, east of the depot.
  turnin 96408
  accept 96392
  kill 264936 quest 96392.1 @64.9,58.5 map 1426 -- Talk to him and choose the farsight
  turnin 96392
  accept 96390

step Dark Iron Spies
  tip Spies roam around Ironband's Compound. The Dark Iron Map can drop from them: right-click it.
  kill 6123 quest 96390
  accept 96391 optional

step Earthseer Farsen
  turnin 96390
  turnin 96391 optional
  accept 96393 optional

step Ironforge: dungeon quests
  zone Ironforge
  tip In the High Seat, take the cobwebbed passage on the left and follow it down to the dungeon.
  accept 96394
  accept 96403

# Groupe Alliance 0.11.0: Knowledge in the Deeps (971) is for Blackfathom Deeps, run in Group 8
# (09-orneval-paluns). Gerrig Bonegrip gives it from level 10 (Polestar's Forever data and the
# TrinityCore Forever world base: no prerequisite), and the route has no other stop in Ironforge
# before that dungeon: asked here, once (`when group 971`), never needed for the rest.
step Ironforge: Gerrig Bonegrip (Blackfathom Deeps, for later)
  when group 971
  tip Knowledge in the Deeps belongs to Blackfathom Deeps, a dungeon the guide offers in Group 8 (Ashenvale, levels 24 to 28). The route passes no other time in Ironforge before it. Planning that dungeon? Take it now: it waits in the quest log. Not sure, or playing alone? Skip it: Group 8 offers the dungeon without it.
  accept 971                                  -- Gerrig Bonegrip, in the Forlorn Cavern

step Enter the Hall of Thanes
  tip Group of 5, level 13 or more. The portal is past the bridge and the meeting stone.
  goto 27.6,47.8 "The Hall of Thanes" r 25

step Inside the dungeon
  tip West wing first: the Ghostly Attendant gives a quest before Faldrim. Each player loots their own heirlooms.
  note Share each quest with your group: click it in the quest log, then Share.
  accept 96395
  complete 96403
  complete 96394
  complete 96393 optional
  turnin 96395
  accept 98423 -- Treaty tablet in the last boss room

step Ironforge rewards
  zone Ironforge
  turnin 96403
  turnin 96394
  turnin 96393 optional
  turnin 98423
